/**
 * useWalmartWeekSelection — State machine for week-level selection in Walmart mode.
 *
 * Click behavior:
 *   • Clicking any day in the calendar selects the ENTIRE Sat-Fri week.
 *   • First click: sets both start-week and end-week to the same week.
 *   • Second click: if the week is after start-week → becomes end-week;
 *     if before start-week → becomes start-week (old start → end).
 *   • Third calendar click resets to a fresh single-week selection.
 *
 * Cross-source reset:
 *   • Dropdown → Calendar: resets selection (fresh start).
 *   • Calendar → Dropdown: adjusts range normally (no reset).
 *   • Dropdown → Dropdown: adjusts range normally (no reset).
 *
 * Two-way sync with DvSelect:
 *   • DvSelect selection updates the calendar selection.
 *   • Calendar click updates DvSelect value.
 *   • DvSelect hover → calendar row highlights (hoverWeek state).
 *   • Calendar row hover → week highlights (DvSelect stays).
 */
